{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30012_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3fc4182b6af0efee73fec2287564c9c4a4a41e76e40f6ebd4c8c638872ccc352",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:729cb1065f5944dfee5271bb21a1d7bd21fcfdd0368a5984ff7cdb03ea15cac6",
      "text": "另一天的录制中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:263c5d166f7b29e207e58a3301a10b1021422b44ec04a83fb835315815bda4d8",
      "text": "今天我们大家，一起来到了兔子公园哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8d44e6185a925f21019825d06f4deb4033a73dc248e7c18f81a6e05e8ec9c6",
      "text": "快看！有小兔子的游乐设施哦！\n超级可爱的对吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50dc8f829cfd364764e73b97f436df0187871e9946d3455b75bc6e49c3aef594",
      "text": "今天，由我们もふもふえん来解答\n裕香小朋友寄来的来信！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d87b00b28342a416dfad95fb5b48ad6cc00ea2c2d6608f21c7be48843164fe33",
      "text": "来信是说，想让我们调查一下为什么这个公园里的\n游乐设施全都是小兔子的形状对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9f999f31622bd5174101207286770047447753c6a4bc49b2891b580857c5b0d",
      "text": "所以，我们请来了管理人员叔叔！\n我说叔叔，为什么全都是小兔子的形状啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b622b1ee81bed32e733c9c64011d297a3fac4f02946c4be6c13c8b791eab1e6e",
      "text": "唔——让我想想。\n其实叔叔也不是特别清楚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c80b109a428548a7994a1b867039b6741e57ae72142416e94783d824864d815",
      "text": "大概是因为建造公园的人，\n很喜欢小兔子吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3899bd9d20d17bb2b6e655a6cf34cc70301fe1cf69ae34f28ec405eb5169b1f1",
      "text": "哇！和花音一样呢！\n小兔子超级可爱的嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18a15491bd1e42ec2eb348c819cce5dc878b651fb6e0c3a3721871dd7ba6d21a",
      "text": "既然要建，建更帅气的\n动物明明更好嘛！比如大灰狼之类的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:442c3405be79e2ae993c8aa92544768591d85fffbecf9fe6093b28664c7852b1",
      "text": "啊哈哈，那样感觉也很有趣呢。\n不过可能有些小朋友会被吓到就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1031332cc7d089fc98b281928fac92a0160dfaf6d9cab880d5b580f7f2c3416b",
      "text": "叔叔，谢谢您告诉我们！\n裕香小朋友，也谢谢你的来信！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
